      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tricky little affair but the resuming TOWER BRIDGE (5) is of interest. He did some nice things last time in, competitive against some horses who went on to better races. 1000m might be on the sharp side but he can sprint well fresh. DREAMZEL (1) is an out-and-out 1000m mare who got the job done here last time out. She'll get a nice run and present at some point. FOXENBERG (6) resumes. His form tapered off at the end of last campaign but he's a sharp horse suited this trip who is right up to winning this fresh. WEAPON CLEAR (4) wasn't far behind DREAMZEL last time and did win well fresh. He can turn the tables. NORDIC STRIKE (7) is racing well enough and should take some beating again.",
